	source_3rdparty_clap_juce_extensions_clap_libs_clap-${_source_3rdparty_clap_juce_extensions_clap_libs_clap}.tar.gz::https://github.com/free-audio/clap/archive/${_source_3rdparty_clap_juce_extensions_clap_libs_clap}.tar.gz
